                                                "sense_id": "50f2acb3-91c6-3913-b19e-f9d863a89d87",
                                                "text": "This Organ is called a Thermometer, or Thermoscope, because the degrees of Heat and Cold are measured and marked by it."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8a731384-44f2-324c-adef-94ab0141e637",
                                        "entry_id": "312ada25-e01b-34ff-8c5a-94af14957b6f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A musical instrument that has multiple pipes which play when a key is pressed (the pipe organ), or an electronic instrument designed to replicate such."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f41bd85f-7441-46f9-9ae8-2af6fc00cddb",
                                                "sense_id": "8a731384-44f2-324c-adef-94ab0141e637",
                                                "text": "He was thinking; but the glory of the song, the swell from the great organ, the clustered lights, […], the height and vastness of this noble fane, its antiquity and its strength—all these things seemed to have their part as causes of the thrilling emotion that accompanied his thoughts."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
