                                                "sense_id": "a5bcc147-afba-3fd9-b9ff-d56fec080131",
                                                "text": "Lieutenant Roberts was also severely wounded by a missile, or weapon called an Organ, which is composed of about thirty-six gun barrels so joined as to fire at once."
